                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "b761587e-8d66-4904-a573-816c7b8b89ea",
                        "entry_id": "6399cd30-8d07-3c24-af49-f0b0886eb55a",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "goublin"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84214a70-3a92-3a4c-9474-b1d4c96f61a8",
                        "entry_id": "6399cd30-8d07-3c24-af49-f0b0886eb55a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Esprit follet, lutin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Fantastique"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7835ce9a-ff79-465d-8c2e-4214e828b9bb",
                                "sense_id": "84214a70-3a92-3a4c-9474-b1d4c96f61a8",
                                "text": "M. Mabeuf s’était mis à feuilleter et à lire, à l’aide de ses lunettes, deux livres qui le passionnaient, et même, chose plus grave à son âge, le préoccupaient […]. Le premier de ces livres était le fameux traité du président Delancre, De l’inconstance des démons, l’autre était l’in-quarto de Mutor de la Rubaudière, Sur les diables de Vauvert et les gobelins de la Bièvre. Ce dernier bouquin l’intéressait d’autant plus que son jardin avait été un des terrains anciennement hantés par les gobelins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f2b3816e-47e8-4aee-9f39-18b2fcce4282",
                                "sense_id": "84214a70-3a92-3a4c-9474-b1d4c96f61a8",
                                "text": "Des êtres surnaturels, répondit le magister Hermod d’une voix qui imposait. Pourquoi ne seraient-ce pas des esprits, des babeaux, des gobelins, peut-être même quelques-unes de ces dangereuses lamies, qui se présentent sous la forme de belles femmes…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e5df12b-5d0e-40b4-a903-dc29324305ea",
                                "sense_id": "84214a70-3a92-3a4c-9474-b1d4c96f61a8",
                                "text": "Je suppose qu’elle avait besoin d’avoir une preuve de plus que cet endroit a été hanté, et qu’elle se l’est offerte à mes dépens. Eh bien oui, il l’est ; il est tout rempli de spectres et de gobelins. Vous avez bien raison de le tenir fermé."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1cc80368-d948-4127-b305-060c92eb7a07",
                        "source_entry_id": "6399cd30-8d07-3c24-af49-f0b0886eb55a",
                        "source_sense_id": "84214a70-3a92-3a4c-9474-b1d4c96f61a8",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kobold",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kobold",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                        "entry_id": "732c96c6-978e-3b5e-9a99-c23a51509e1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "zwergenhaftes Geistwesen, das mit anderen Schabernack treibt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "872a9b9d-d4b4-4c1c-b1a5-7cd56e197ef1",
                                                "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                                "text": "Das Glück ist ein hinterhältiger Kobold: Es bereitet ihm offenbar größten Spaß, uns kurz vor dem Ziel noch rasch ein Bein zu stellen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7aa225d8-2cde-4499-900b-b9e019ea24d4",
                                                "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                                "text": "„Im Gegensatz zu dem schwerfälligen Kobold war sie von sprühender Intelligenz.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2aa0328-253d-4b05-b86b-9cc5bdd4c567",
                                                "sense_id": "717afcc2-1727-3ca5-a9ed-b2ae8a9061f9",
                                                "text": "„Zunächst richteten die Kobolde keinen Schaden an.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4ec9f5b-8196-3f8b-9223-6b6719a974ca",
                                        "entry_id": "732c96c6-978e-3b5e-9a99-c23a51509e1c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Blitz oberhalb einer Wolke"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "92bbafd0-2f49-4230-8c51-39e2cd7ae701",
                                                "sense_id": "d4ec9f5b-8196-3f8b-9223-6b6719a974ca",
                                                "text": "Kobolde bekommt man nur selten zu sehen, obwohl sie ein sehr häufiges Phänomen sind."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d321306-6f51-45cb-8386-617c432180e8",
                        "source_entry_id": "6399cd30-8d07-3c24-af49-f0b0886eb55a",
                        "source_sense_id": "84214a70-3a92-3a4c-9474-b1d4c96f61a8",
                        "target_lang_word": "goblin",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "goblin",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8eb9b34f-b456-3696-b53c-f91b292fb5c9",
                                        "entry_id": "ebc2d65f-e36e-35a5-acbd-18b211dcc95d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A malevolent and grotesque diminutive humanoid, often associated with orcs or trolls."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7b47686-7613-4b25-80da-418823575c8f",
                                                "sense_id": "8eb9b34f-b456-3696-b53c-f91b292fb5c9",
                                                "text": "From yͤ hagg & hungry Goblin,\nyͭ into raggs would rend yee,\n& yͤ spirit yͭ stand’s by yͤ naked man,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb6ce833-d58c-4a4f-9a21-0445dfd64ebf",
                                                "sense_id": "8eb9b34f-b456-3696-b53c-f91b292fb5c9",
                                                "text": "\"[…]If he had struck a stroke more to the side just here,\" said the goblin, tapping the very stone, as it seemed to Curdie, against which his head lay, \"he would have been through; but he's a couple of yards past it now, and if he follow the lode it will be a week before it leads him in.[…]\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c3f6b751-9838-43ea-82b5-72d5467fac8b",
                                                "sense_id": "8eb9b34f-b456-3696-b53c-f91b292fb5c9",
                                                "text": "At last the goblins had a chance to rid themselves of one of the troublesome defenders, and two goblin warriors snatched the opportunity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5455f744-8ea5-4931-82b4-4422d96b6d97",
                                                "sense_id": "8eb9b34f-b456-3696-b53c-f91b292fb5c9",
                                                "text": "The goblin shifted the two younger ones closer to him. It looked like he was hiding behind them, using them as a shield.\nThe goblin looked pure evil. His eyes were brown."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "119ea5bd-b28c-4ee9-9ba5-f0af6849e44c",
                                                "sense_id": "8eb9b34f-b456-3696-b53c-f91b292fb5c9",
                                                "text": "I shall send another entourage of goblins back here to Desput with the goblins’ new ally the Pixy! These creatures deserve the same respect as any other goblin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8593ed7c-75d7-4c68-9c71-55a579ecf770",
                                                "sense_id": "8eb9b34f-b456-3696-b53c-f91b292fb5c9",
                                                "text": "Risk is everywhere. From tabloid headlines insisting that coffee causes cancer (yesterday, of course, it cured it) to stern government warnings about alcohol and driving, the world is teeming with goblins. For each one there is a frighteningly precise measurement of just how likely it is to jump from the shadows and get you."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f5f8896-30b7-3ea7-a702-b4d124962065",
                                        "entry_id": "ebc2d65f-e36e-35a5-acbd-18b211dcc95d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A hoodoo."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33edb85c-fe55-4187-bf88-2c7214542e89",
                                                "sense_id": "6f5f8896-30b7-3ea7-a702-b4d124962065",
                                                "text": "Layers of sandstone serve as capstones of pillars and buttes; other layers of differing hardness yield erosional goblins of myriad form."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab0c4b6d-0794-3aa6-8c02-15d7a9166d6b",
                                        "entry_id": "ebc2d65f-e36e-35a5-acbd-18b211dcc95d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Short for goblin shark"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95e6aed7-5d75-434b-a188-99e31dee224d",
                                                "sense_id": "ab0c4b6d-0794-3aa6-8c02-15d7a9166d6b",
                                                "text": "Goblins are mainly found (when they are found at all) in deep waters."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "95895d3e-9730-4c8c-8969-b10d8a10606f",
                        "source_entry_id": "6399cd30-8d07-3c24-af49-f0b0886eb55a",
